# Custom Helpdesk & Ticketing Systems

Category: Business Management Solutions

Custom customer support and ticketing platforms to resolve inquiries faster across all channels.

Don't let support tickets slip through the cracks. Our Custom Helpdesk Solutions consolidate customer inquiries from email, WhatsApp, SMS, web chat, and phone calls into a single unified inbox. With smart ticket routing, collision detection, canned replies, and detailed SLA tracking, your support agents can resolve tickets faster with less stress.

Key features:
- Unified Inbox: Aggregate email, WhatsApp, and web chats in one window. No channel hopping.
- SLA & Escalation: Automated alerts for overdue tickets and custom routing rules. Guaranteed response times.
- Canned Responses: One-click templates for common customer queries. Consistent, fast support.
- CSAT Surveys: Automated feedback collections after ticket resolution. Track agent performance.

FAQs:

Q: Can we integrate WhatsApp customer support into this helpdesk?
A: Yes, we plug the official WhatsApp Business API directly into your helpdesk so agents can chat in real-time from the unified inbox.

Q: How do you prevent two agents from answering the same ticket?
A: We build an active collision detection system that locks a ticket when an agent is viewing or drafting a response.

Q: Do you enforce response-time SLAs automatically?
A: Yes - the SLA and escalation feature triggers automated alerts for overdue tickets and routes them per your custom escalation rules, so nothing sits unanswered.

Q: Can we measure customer satisfaction after a ticket closes?
A: Yes, automated CSAT surveys go out after resolution, giving you a direct read on agent performance rather than guessing.

